1
00:00:00,041 --> 00:00:01,626
Why are you guys
training by yourselves?

2
00:00:01,626 --> 00:00:02,626
Jaeseong!

3
00:00:03,253 --> 00:00:05,755
Let's do some catch-ball
together.

4
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,762
Since when have you been
training in secret?

5
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:13,972
Like a rat.

6
00:00:14,097 --> 00:00:15,097
Wait.

7
00:00:15,432 --> 00:00:16,432
A rat?

8
00:00:22,647 --> 00:00:23,690
Yeah, a rat.

9
00:00:24,024 --> 00:00:25,650
You don't do group training.

10
00:00:25,817 --> 00:00:27,700
You don't even listen to
Jeong Ho, our captain.

11
00:00:40,081 --> 00:00:41,081
Right, Jeongho?

12
00:00:42,709 --> 00:00:43,709
No.

13
00:00:45,336 --> 00:00:46,546
Jaeseong
it's not like that...

14
00:00:46,546 --> 00:00:49,799
If you made a promise,
live up to it, Kim Taehun!

15
00:00:56,514 --> 00:00:58,274
If the couch knows about
this, we're screwed.

16
00:00:58,683 --> 00:00:59,684
So you should go back in.

17
00:01:01,978 --> 00:01:02,978
See you guys.
